OL,3,AAustralian music legend Molly Meldrum  
OL,4,Adies aged 83                           
OL,6,FAustralian music industry legend Molly 
OL,7,FMeldrum has died aged 83 after a long  
OL,8,Fillness.                               
OL,10,FThe music promoter and broadcaster,    
OL,11,Fborn Ian Alexander Meldrum, helped     
OL,12,Fdefine the nation's music tastes for   
OL,13,Fdecades, championing local artists like
OL,14,FINXS and Kylie Minogue and global acts 
OL,15,Flike Abba.                             
OL,17,FKnown for his chaotic demeanour and    
OL,18,Ftrademark Stetson hat, he interviewed  
OL,19,Fan array of stars from King Charles to 
OL,20,FElton John, who described Meldrum as   
OL,21,Fthe "single most important influence in
OL,22,FAustralian pop music".                 
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
