OL,3,AAustralian music legend Molly Meldrum  
OL,4,Adies aged 83                           
OL,6,FIn a statement, Meldrum's family said  
OL,7,Fhe "passed away peacefully" at a       
OL,8,Fhospital in Melbourne in the early     
OL,9,Fhours of Monday morning.               
